WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.463
Real estate in Orange County
is better than it's ever been.

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:08.717
I've hit the $100-million sales
milestone, which is a big deal.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.843
Ring it hard.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:12.846
Big announcement.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:16.433
In Cabo San Lucas, we have
our first billion-dollar listing.

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:19.561
-Billion? Like, with the "B"?
-Yeah, let's all get rich.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.357
-This is the vibe.
-Cheers.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.150
You guys are here
before the LA office.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.860
This is what I'm talking about.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.028
Let the race begin.

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:30.781
Get a bucket.

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.909
People are thinking
that we're messy as a brokerage.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.619
Everybody in OC's talking about it.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.454
What's the latest
with you and Rose?

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:38.956
She's unprofessional.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.707
-Are you single?
-Yeah.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.584
People can think
whatever they want to think.

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:44.336
Let's remember,
this is a small town.

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:45.587
Reputations matter.

00:00:45.671 --> 00:00:48.257
I think you guys are too friendly.
It looks sloppy.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.050
I don't give a--

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.635
Remind me never to piss you off.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.680
We have a new agent.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:55.931
She'll ruffle a few feathers.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:58.433
She's pretty, charismatic,
but overrated.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.853
You think everything's so easy.

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:03.313
She's Jarvis 2.0.

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:06.650
-To taking over OC.
-I love it.

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:10.279
The numbers here
just blow my mind.

00:01:10.362 --> 00:01:12.447
It is our biggest listing ever.
Thirty-nine million.

00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:16.827
You went to my client
behind my back.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.413
There's a lot of hypocrisy.
-You don't know my personal life.

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.998
I want you to stop talking about me.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:26.878
You have been showing people
a video of me and Tyler.

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:28.630
-Really?
-Is there a video?

00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:30.966
-Did you see a video?
-Shots are fired.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:32.426
It's time for it to go down.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:35.262
What advice do you have?

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.638
Choose a different career.

